- Playwright + TypeScript. POM in pages/. Tests in tests/ui and tests/api.
- Semantic locators first. Cart rows: .cart_item.
- No waitForTimeout. No skipped tests.
- API auth: Cookie token=, never Bearer.
- Restful Booker DELETE success is often 201. Empty POST /booking has returned 500.
- Do not add bonus/snapshots to the default Playwright projects.
